msgid "When visitors reach the portal through a proxy such as Cloudflare, every request comes from the proxy. Trust its addresses so the visitor address is read from the header it sends: sign-in rules, rate limits and logs then see the real visitor. Trust only addresses that are really your proxy, never a whole network."
